   - **Pseudocode:**
   ```
   IF element exists 
       PROCEED with interaction
   ELSE 
       LOG error or handle absent element error
   ```
   
By adhering to these guidelines, the robustness of the code can be improved, enhancing the functionality and user experience of the application.
